s10-p13 = prose (cons "**Handler composition and safety transfer.** A command handler interprets each request in a world transition relation. Let \(h_1,h_2\) be two handlers, and \(R:W_1\to W_2\to\mathcal U\) a simulation relation. If for every related pair \(R(w_1,w_2)\), each \(h_2\)-transition with response \(r\) has a matching \(h_1\)-transition with the same selected observation and related successor worlds, then the relation lifts coinductively to the processes interpreted by the handlers. The proof proceeds by cases on `return`, internal delay, and `request`; the request case uses the supplied step simulation and the induction/coinduction hypothesis on the continuation." nil)
